{"id":"300479d2bc","t":"Surviving as a PD Idol","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/images-8.jpeg","n":49,"l":49,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol"},"u":1795038263817,"desc":"منتج سيئ السمعة، مكروه من الجميع، يصبح نجمًا مجهولًا في عالم موازٍ. وحده شقيقه الأصغر يتذكره تمامًا. ليعود إلى عالمه الأصلي، عليه أن يصبح نجمًا بارزًا ويفوز باللعبة! “…تم قبول المهمة.” “هل أنت مجنون؟” “يجب أن آكل لأعيش، أليس كذلك؟” تخصصه الترهيب، وهوايته الإقناع. قصة نجاة مثالية لمنتج شرس لا يلين!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["تجسيد","خيال","دراما","كوميدى","موسيقى"],"src":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/1/"},"2":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/2/"},"3":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/3/"},"4":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/4/"},"5":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/5/"},"6":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/6/"},"7":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/7/"},"8":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/8/"},"9":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/9/"},"10":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/10/"},"11":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/11/"},"12":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/12/"},"13":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/13/"},"14":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/14/"},"15":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/15/"},"16":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/16/"},"17":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/17/"},"18":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/18/"},"19":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/surviving-as-a-pd-idol/19/"},"20":{"ml":"surviving-as-a-pd-idol|/manga/survivi